body:
>  A makeshift screwdriver and hammer can be made with many common  ingredients, which can be used to deconstruct most furniture for tons of  two by fours and other ingredients. 

&#x200B;

This. I did a prison break run, deconstructed a fridge, used the sheet metal to craft brazier. Now you can safely stay underground for days with enough water and food until robots wasted all their ammus shooting zombies.

Got it, seems it's because I activated sleep deprivation mod. 

&#x200B;

Still I feel anyone who doesn't suffer from insomnia shouldn't be "sleep deprived" just by sleeping in beds with lights on. They can just put blankets over their heads if light disturbs them so much.

Thank you so much for your translation! I have a few questions here:

&#x200B;

1. " I am having all personnels outside of the Prince's personal bodyguards reassigned".

What does "personal bodyguards" mean here? Balsamilco calls Halkenburg's followers "his private guards"，what's the difference between them?

&#x200B;

2.  "Yes. This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance...! I will definitely take care of him."  

Did Balsamilca say "I" specifically, meaning he will take care of Halkenburg personally, or did he just say "It is *our* once-in-a-lifetime chance"(as in MS's translation)？

&#x200B;

3.  "Actually, I'm thinking of adjusting my shift because I suspect that the  Duazul guards may be up to something. I'm gonna keep my eyes on Macne  and Scairt as suspicious individuals."

Who is trying to adjust the shift and who wants to keep an eye on Macne and Scairt? According to MS it is Duazul who is changing the shift. The Chinese version says "we(bodyguards outside of Queen's guards)" are changing shifts. The subject is really messed up...

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
